---
description: Centralize constants; avoid hardcoded routes/keys/event names/thresholds.
globs: "client/app/**/*.ts, client/app/**/*.tsx, client/lib/**/*.ts, server/**/*.cs"
alwaysApply: false
---

## Constants and "no magic values" (critical)

- Avoid magic values: defaults, thresholds, timings, delays, labels, storage keys, route strings, query keys, event names.
- Create constants in `client/lib/constants/*` (feature-based modules) for frontend.
- Create constants in `GatekeeperHQ.Domain/Constants/` for backend (.NET).

## Never hardcode these (Frontend)

- localStorage/sessionStorage keys -> `STORAGE_KEYS`
- custom event names -> `CUSTOM_EVENTS`
- react-query keys -> `QUERY_KEYS`
- route strings -> `ROUTES`
- API endpoints -> centralized API client

## Never hardcode these (Backend)

- Permission strings -> `Permissions.cs`
- Configuration values -> `appsettings.json`
- Error messages -> constants or resource files
